### ===================================================================
### SPRINT 8 PAYROLL - END-TO-END VERIFICATION & TEST SUITE
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/payroll
@periodId = 8e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 1: Read Master Data & Setup
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Read Active Salary Components
GET {{baseUrl}}/SalaryComponents
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2 Read Salary Structures with Expanded Line Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/SalaryStructures?$expand=items($expand=salaryComponent)
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.3 Read Active Payroll Periods
GET {{baseUrl}}/PayrollPeriods
Content-Type: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 2: Validate Data Integrity & Guardrails (Negative Tests)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Test Duplicate Component Code Validation (Should Fail: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SalaryComponents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "componentCode": "BASIC PAY",
  "componentName": "Basic Salary Duplicate",
  "componentType": "Earning",
  "calculationType": "Percentage"
}

### 2.2 Test Negative CTC Validation (Should Fail: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/EmployeeSalaries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "salaryStructure_ID": "8b000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "monthlyCTC": 100000.00,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-07-01"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 3: Core Payroll Engine Trigger (ProcessPayroll)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Calculate Batch Payroll for Period PAY202607
POST {{baseUrl}}/PayrollPeriods('{{periodId}}')/PayrollService.ProcessPayroll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otRateMultiplier": 1.50
}

### 3.2 Verify Calculated Process Headers & Prorated Line Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/PayrollProcesses?$filter=payrollPeriod_ID eq {{periodId}}&$expand=employee,details($expand=salaryComponent)
Content-Type: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 4: Single Record Recalculation & Approval Flow
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Recalculate Individual Record
POST {{baseUrl}}/PayrollProcesses('8e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001')/PayrollService.RecalculatePayroll
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4.2 Approve Complete Payroll Batch for July 2026
POST {{baseUrl}}/PayrollPeriods('{{periodId}}')/PayrollService.ApprovePayrollBatch
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4.3 Verify Generated Payslip Metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/Payslips?$expand=payrollProcess($expand=employee)
Content-Type: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### TEST 5: Lock Period & Audit Trail
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Lock Payroll Period (Prevent Modifications)
POST {{baseUrl}}/PayrollPeriods('{{periodId}}')/PayrollService.LockPayroll
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5.2 Attempt Execution on Locked Period (Should Fail: 400)

### 1. Unlock Payroll Period
POST {{baseUrl}}/PayrollPeriods('8e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002')/PayrollService.UnlockPayroll
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 1. Process Payroll for Open Period
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/payroll/PayrollPeriods('8e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002')/PayrollService.ProcessPayroll
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otRateMultiplier": 1.50
}


### 5.3 Read Immutable Audit Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/PayrollHistories?$orderby=performedOn desc
Content-Type: application/json